{"seq":8,"slug":"distributed-transactions-consistency","title":"分布式事务与一致性","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency","rating":{"composite":3.86,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 分布式事务与一致性 简介\n\n跨多个节点或服务维持数据正确，是分布式后端最深的难题。本 hub 面向需要理解一致性理论以做出清醒架构取舍的后端工程师，从一致性模型（CAP/PACELC、强一致与最终一致光谱、分布式隔离级别）讲起，覆盖提交协议（2PC、3PC 的极限、TCC）、共识（共识问题、Raft 直觉、法定人数与复制），以及一致性抉择（线性一致的代价、为系统选模型、工程实践）。它从理论侧补全姊妹 hub「幂等、重试与补偿」的应用侧。贯穿全篇的主线与整个后端工程品类一致：一致性是手段不是目的，把强一致需求收进尽量小的边界用本地事务保证，其余用最终一致换性能与可用，并拥抱 CAP/FLP 揭示的根本不可能性。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"consistency-models","title":"Consistency Models","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/consistency-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cap-and-pacelc","title":"CAP 与 PACELC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/consistency-models/cap-and-pacelc"},{"seq":2,"slug":"strong-vs-eventual","title":"强一致与最终一致","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/consistency-models/strong-vs-eventual"},{"seq":3,"slug":"isolation-levels-distributed","title":"分布式环境下的隔离级别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/consistency-models/isolation-levels-distributed"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"commit-protocols","title":"Commit Protocols","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/commit-protocols","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"two-phase-commit","title":"两阶段提交","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-consistency/commit-protocols/two-phase-commit"},{"seq":2,"slug":"three-phase-and-limits","title":"三阶段提交与协议的极限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transactions-c